{"name":"Pricing Table","html":"<section class=\"mrspb-section\" style=\"padding: 60px 20px; background: #f8fafc;\"><div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 40px;\">Pricing Plans</h2><div class=\"mrspb-row\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px;\"><div style=\"background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><h3>Basic</h3><p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;\">$9/mo</p><p>Essential features for starters.</p><a href=\"#\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">Choose</a></div><div style=\"background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05); border: 2px solid #2563eb;\"><h3>Pro</h3><p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;\">$29/mo</p><p>Advanced tools and analytics.</p><a href=\"#\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">Choose</a></div><div style=\"background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><h3>Agency</h3><p style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;\">$79/mo</p><p>White-label and priority support.</p><a href=\"#\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">Choose</a></div></div></div></section>","css":""}
